  "description": "SIJCEW crystallizes in the trigonal crystal system with space group P 31 2 1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C57 H70 Dy4 N12 O27,2(H2 O1),2(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1D (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2D (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.888-3.897 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 108.92-111.63°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(CO3)(L)4(acac)2(CH3OH)2(H2O)2]·CH3OH·H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
